1
00:00:00,418 --> 00:00:03,258
(Sheldon:)...from Victorian England
into the post-apocalyptic future...

2
00:00:03,421 --> 00:00:05,671
...where society had splintered
into two factions:

3
00:00:05,840 --> 00:00:07,220
(Sheldon:)the subterranean Morlocks...

4
00:00:07,383 --> 00:00:11,433
(Sheldon:)...who survived by feasting on the flesh
of the gentle surface-dwelling Eloi.

5
00:00:13,264 --> 00:00:16,604
(Howard:)Talk about your chick magnets.

6
00:00:17,852 --> 00:00:20,692
(Raj:)Oh, yeah. The guy who lives next to me
is always like:

7
00:00:20,855 --> 00:00:24,315
"I have a Jacuzzi on my balcony.
I have a Jacuzzi on my balcony."

8
00:00:24,484 --> 00:00:28,444
(Raj:)But wait until I tell him
I've got a time machine on my balcony.

9
00:00:29,781 --> 00:00:32,911
(Raj:)Stuff that in your Speedos, Jacuzzi Bob.

10
00:00:33,534 --> 00:00:35,284
Gentlemen, we said we'd take turns...

11
00:00:35,453 --> 00:00:38,993
...but I think you'll agree
that practicality dictates it remain here.

12
00:00:39,165 --> 00:00:41,455
You can't keep it.
What if I meet a girl and say:

13
00:00:41,626 --> 00:00:44,336
"You wanna see my time machine?
It's at my friend's house."

14
00:00:44,504 --> 00:00:46,634
(Howard:)How lame is that?

15
00:00:46,798 --> 00:00:48,338
- He's got a point.
SHELDON: All right.

16
00:00:48,508 --> 00:00:52,138
(Sheldon:)We're going to need some ground rules.
"No shoes in the time machine."

17
00:00:52,303 --> 00:00:54,803
"No eating in the time machine."
I propose that we add:

18
00:00:54,972 --> 00:00:59,022
"Pants must be worn at all times
in the time machine."

